It's working just fine for me with a Hauppauge WinTV/pci; I use either
the v4l in the kernel (2.1.120pre2 or later) or bttv-0.5.15 (add
"-D_ALPHA_BTTV" to CFLAGS in the driver Makefile). 

The only catch is that the msp3400 module (which your card might not need)
uses "__down_interruptible"; you have to patch the kernel (alpha_ksyms.c
