Hermelito Go wrote:
> 
> Hi,
>         My system is a PWSa500 (MIATA) w/ RH5.1, kernel 2.0.34. My problem
> is that the clock is running very fast or is not reading the hardware
> clock. How can I fix this, is there a patch for this, or did I miss some
