This is a fairly common problem. The fix that worked for me and many
other people was to use a newer MILO. FTP to gatekeeper.dec.com and grab
/pub/DEC/Linux-Alpha/Kernels/milo-miata-980609 . That should do the
trick.

HTH
Matt


