No, its a common problem.

Even people who have told me they don't have the problem, do in
fact have it.  A lot of times you won't know it.  The error can
show up as a long delay that you might attribute to slow networking
or something like that.  A good test is to run another browser and
see who gets that initial connection faster or at all.

Netscape has some severe problems.

You should strace/ltract it sometime and see how many calls it makes,
even when it supposedly should be idle.

