OK, OK, Nils, guys, this is how it looks, cachewise:

CPU				L1(in CPU)			L2(in CPU)		L2 or L3(on board)
SX (21164PC)		L1:16K+8K dual-port	0K			L2:1024K
LX (21164A)			L1:16K+16K			L2:96K		L3:2048K or 4096K

