Maybe ... hardware intensive I meant (bad example I know but I have no
other) is playing games, i.e. using sound, harddisk, input devices
(keyboard/mouse) at the same time.
Sometimes tha hangs then show as a console beep not just playing for a
fraction of a second but for some seconds! The timer inetrrupt is just not
coming through so the beep does not stop... after some time the system clock
is also wrong then...

> BTW I'm running 2.1.105.
With kernel after 2.1.120 you will have to patch it (problem persists up to
2.1.123) using a diff I have at
