Yes you can do it.

With alpha it is especially easy.  All you have to do is in your BIOS
set up separate boot many.  So that it will say something like :
disk1partition1 \linload.exe.
Of course the exact syntax will be different depending on your
motherboard and how you going to install.  Remember that win arc will
give you an error when you try to use the above line.  That is because
it expects different type of a file.  Ignore the error and do your
installation.

